  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">23M-Rikolto - Boosting incomes and climate resilience for rural coffee communities in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project main objective is the development of a business case between
three organisations persuading rural communities livelihoods enhancement
combined with climate change adaptation and mitigation through 1) the
provision of clean cooking alternatives (biochar-producing gasifier cookstoves
and clean briquettes), 2) the transformation to regenerative farming practices
for coffee farmers and 3) the provision of access to market and sourcing of
Carbon Low Coffee from coffee farmers to ETG, going to coffee roasters.</narrative>
  </description>
